  {
    "id": "lerobot-tab",
    "type": "tab",
    "label": "LeRobot",
    "disabled": false,
    "info": "LeRobot control via @rrcf/node-robot-lerobot, wrapping the leLab backend.\n\nThe lerobot-config node holds the backend URL (local sidecar or a GPU box).\nThe full leLab UI — calibrate / teleoperate / record / browse / train / replay —\nis embedded inside node-robot at /lerobot.html.\n\nThe lerobot-bridge path is the novel bit: it turns THIS robot's live RRCF\ntelemetry into a LeRobot-shaped episode (observation.state / action), which\nleLab's arm-only recording cannot do."
  },
  {
    "id": "lerobot-cfg",
    "type": "lerobot-config",
    "name": "local sidecar",
    "baseUrl": "http://localhost:8000"
  },
  {
    "id": "lr-in-datasets",
    "type": "inject",
    "z": "lerobot-tab",
    "name": "list datasets",
    "props": [{ "p": "payload" }],
    "repeat": "",
    "once": false,
    "topic": "",
    "payload": "",
    "payloadType": "date",
    "x": 160,
    "y": 100,
    "wires": [["lr-datasets"]]
  },
  {
    "id": "lr-datasets",
    "type": "lerobot-dataset",
    "z": "lerobot-tab",
    "name": "",
    "server": "lerobot-cfg",
    "action": "list",
    "datasetRepoId": "",
    "x": 390,
    "y": 100,
    "wires": [["lr-debug"]]
  },
  {
    "id": "lr-in-record",
    "type": "inject",
    "z": "lerobot-tab",
    "name": "record (test mode)",
    "props": [
      { "p": "payload" },
      { "p": "action", "v": "start", "vt": "str" }
    ],
    "repeat": "",
    "once": false,
    "topic": "",
    "payload": "{\"dataset_repo_id\":\"local/test-episode\",\"single_task\":\"demo\",\"test_mode\":true,\"num_episodes\":1}",
    "payloadType": "json",
    "x": 170,
    "y": 180,
    "wires": [["lr-record"]]
  },
  {
    "id": "lr-record",
    "type": "lerobot-record",
    "z": "lerobot-tab",
    "name": "",
    "server": "lerobot-cfg",
    "action": "start",
    "datasetRepoId": "",
    "singleTask": "",
    "numEpisodes": 1,
    "episodeTimeS": 30,
    "resetTimeS": 10,
    "fps": 30,
    "video": true,
    "pushToHub": false,
    "testMode": true,
    "x": 400,
    "y": 180,
    "wires": [["lr-debug"]]
  },
  {
    "id": "lr-bridge-start",
    "type": "inject",
    "z": "lerobot-tab",
    "name": "bridge: start",
    "props": [{ "p": "command", "v": "start", "vt": "str" }, { "p": "task", "v": "demo patrol", "vt": "str" }],
    "repeat": "",
    "once": false,
    "x": 160,
    "y": 280,
    "wires": [["lr-bridge"]]
  },
  {
    "id": "lr-bridge-stop",
    "type": "inject",
    "z": "lerobot-tab",
    "name": "bridge: stop",
    "props": [{ "p": "command", "v": "stop", "vt": "str" }],
    "repeat": "",
    "once": false,
    "x": 160,
    "y": 340,
    "wires": [["lr-bridge"]]
  },
  {
    "id": "lr-bridge",
    "type": "lerobot-bridge",
    "z": "lerobot-tab",
    "name": "RRCF to LeRobot",
    "task": "demo patrol",
    "stateKeys": "",
    "maxFrames": 100000,
    "x": 410,
    "y": 310,
    "wires": [["lr-debug"]]
  },
  {
    "id": "lr-debug",
    "type": "debug",
    "z": "lerobot-tab",
    "name": "lerobot result",
    "active": true,
    "tosidebar": true,
    "complete": "payload",
    "targetType": "msg",
    "x": 650,
    "y": 180,
    "wires": []
  },
  {
    "id": "lr-comment",
    "type": "comment",
    "z": "lerobot-tab",
    "name": "Full LeRobot UI is embedded at /lerobot.html",
    "info": "The lerobot-* nodes here are for flow automation. For the full interactive UI — calibrate, teleoperate, dataset browser with frame-by-frame video, training logs, replay — open /lerobot.html, which embeds leLab inside node-robot.\n\nAll of this needs the leLab backend running (pip install -e leLab; lelab). The record inject uses test_mode:true so it runs with no SO-101 arm attached.",
    "x": 230,
    "y": 420,
    "wires": []
  }
]
